mission "The Wreck of the Saint Oria"
    name "The Wreck of the Saint Oria"
    description "Recover a logbook from the expedition's flagship, wrecked beyond the outer reef."
    source "Port de Lune"
    destination "Wreckers' Moon"
    reward 1785
    speaker offer "Marda Quill"
    speaker visit "Marda Quill"
    speaker complete "Marda Quill"
    to offer
        has "The False Beacon: done"
    on offer
        conversation
            `Recover a logbook from the expedition's flagship, wrecked beyond the outer reef.`
            `Marda Quill studies you for a moment. "The old sea charter settled one war, but it did not settle the past. The lost expedition sailed west under a sealed order, and its wake is stirring every ambitious captain in these waters."
            choice
                `(I will help uncover what happened.)`
                    accept
                `(Tell me what you are not saying.)`
                    goto details
                `(I have no wish to be drawn into another quarrel.)`
                    close
            label details
                `Marda Quill lowers their voice. "The maps were altered, the convoy erased from the books, and someone has been buying witnesses. Follow the evidence, not the flags."`
                choice
                    `(Then I will take the matter in hand.)`
                        accept
                    `(Not today.)`
                        close
    on accept
        log "Accepted The Wreck of the Saint Oria. Recover a logbook from the expedition's flagship, wrecked beyond the outer reef."
    on visit
        conversation
            `Marda Quill receives you at Wreckers' Moon. The evidence fits another piece into the puzzle: the expedition was not searching for gold alone, but for a place deliberately removed from every official chart.`
    on complete
        conversation
            `Marda Quill thanks you. "Every answer makes the sea less simple, captain. Yet the truth belongs to the people who live here, not to the first crown or company that can put a seal upon it."`
        log "Completed The Wreck of the Saint Oria. Received 1785 gold. Recover a logbook from the expedition's flagship, wrecked beyond the outer reef."
